exists su name src-7b5d10bc20a86cb16d320a9310afe3c751b5e21483a4c72a99ce08104d5eaa28 ob text quoted.text.# Data Handling Policy

Personal data must be encrypted at rest.

Teams must report incidents within 24 hours.

## Retention

Records are retained for 30 days.
